# Trivy ignore file — list CVE IDs (one per line) that we have evaluated
# and determined are not exploitable in our deployment context. Each entry
# MUST include a comment explaining the rationale and a re-evaluation date.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN  # <rationale> (review by YYYY-MM-DD)
#
# Example:
#   CVE-2024-12345  # transitive in pdf renderer, not reachable from API (review by 2026-12-01)
#
# Keep this file lean — every entry is technical debt. Prefer bumping the
# vulnerable dep over silencing the alert.
